ibus-handwrite-chinese (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Migrate from static 幽兰百合/tegaki models to PP-OCRv6 ONNX model
    (18710 chars) with full CI validation and 100% top-1 accuracy.
  * Unicode OCR pipeline: self-contained ONNX Runtime engine replaces
    external tegaki, no more dictionary dependencies.
  * Evdev trackpad: support ABS_MT_TRACKING_ID in addition to BTN_TOUCH,
    expands compatibility to modern trackpads.
  * ESC reliability: ESC now pauses/closes in all states; Enter and
    Backspace only intercepted when actively writing (state 0).
  * Firefox compatible: ESC now works in Firefox and any app that sends
    IBUS_RELEASE_MASK key events.
  --test mode: window receives keyboard focus (set_accept_focus).
  * Cross-distro bootstrap.sh with auto-detection, udev rule for
    trackpad access, sg input fallback in wrapper script.
  * Debian packaging: deb, RPM, Arch PKGBUILD with postinst hook
    for model download, venv creation, and wrapper installation.
  * Architecture: arm64 support for Debian/Ubuntu packages.
  * CI: multi-distro CI with 5 containers; Release workflow builds
    .deb, .rpm, and source tarball for GitHub Releases.

 -- ibus-handwrite-chinese developers <dev@ibus-handwrite-chinese.example.com>  Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

ibus-handwrite-chinese (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Beta release.
  * macOS-style floating handwriting panel with evdev touchpad input.
  * V1 features: delete button, ESC state machine, tap-to-select,
    cursor-proximity positioning, drag handle.
  * 幽兰百合 Community v1.1.0 model (9,374 chars) for Simplified Chinese.
  * tegaki zh_TW (11,853 chars) for Traditional Chinese.
  * CI tested on Debian 11/12, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Fedora 40/41,
    Arch Linux, openSUSE Tumbleweed.

 -- ibus-handwrite-chinese developers <dev@ibus-handwrite-chinese.example.com>  Sun, 14 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
